WEBVTT

00:33.725 --> 00:34.868
I'm home!

00:35.853 --> 00:37.438
Welcome back, Riju.

00:39.273 --> 00:40.956
Hello, we've come over to visit.

00:40.956 --> 00:42.130
Hello!

00:42.401 --> 00:44.194
Oh, welcome!

00:45.446 --> 00:47.390
Let's go play games in your room!

00:47.391 --> 00:47.869
Okay!

00:49.032 --> 00:51.042
Come on, Riju, hurry up!

00:51.042 --> 00:51.868
I'm coming!

00:51.868 --> 00:54.300
Want me to bring up some snacks later?

00:54.391 --> 00:56.651
Yeah, thanks!

00:58.913 --> 01:02.608
Damnit! No matter how many times I drive
them away, they keep spawning!

01:02.959 --> 01:06.437
Those little worms dare to put their arms around my Riju!

01:07.132 --> 01:09.958
Oh, I know very well...

01:09.959 --> 01:14.297
that you're all just brutes trying to prey on Riju!

01:09.959 --> 01:14.291
Bottle: laxative

01:17.633 --> 01:23.620
KIREPAPA

01:21.596 --> 01:22.436
I'm coming in!

01:31.241 --> 01:33.567
How about some cake?

01:33.585 --> 01:38.518
Episode 1: Do You Like Beautiful Dad?

01:43.420 --> 01:46.305
Chisato-san, sorry for the trouble every time.

01:46.632 --> 01:48.350
Oh, Shunsuke-kun...

01:48.350 --> 01:52.044
I should thank you for always being
such a good friend to Riju.

01:52.044 --> 01:55.697
Well, you know... I really love Riju.

01:56.523 --> 01:58.827
Oh... Have fun, everyone.

02:04.900 --> 02:07.219
Sakaki Shunsuke, you little brat!

02:07.219 --> 02:10.001
Shamelessly talking like that in front of me...!

02:10.001 --> 02:13.958
One day I'll commit a perfect crime and exterminate you!

02:16.119 --> 02:18.611
Hey, Riju! Who was that person?

02:18.611 --> 02:20.480
She was really pretty!

02:20.480 --> 02:22.523
Could that be your older sister?

02:22.523 --> 02:23.958
Is she going out with anyone right now?

02:24.253 --> 02:26.916
Well, he has an ex-wife.

02:27.256 --> 02:30.394
Meaning, do you still like him if he's a beautiful dad?

02:37.698 --> 02:39.176
Crap! It's Funaba!

02:39.685 --> 02:40.437
Hello?

02:41.393 --> 02:44.480
Y-Yeah, I'm working on it right now!

02:44.480 --> 02:47.523
Of course it'll be done on time!

02:47.523 --> 02:49.045
Please excuse us!

02:50.445 --> 02:52.479
Don't ever come back.

02:52.480 --> 02:55.480
N-No, nothing at all. Just talking to someone else.

02:56.660 --> 03:00.175
Are you serious?! You really have Saki Shunka-sensei's...?

03:02.749 --> 03:04.349
Thanks, Funaba!

03:05.437 --> 03:08.045
Why the hell are you still here?

03:08.463 --> 03:11.305
That's not fair! You didn't touch the cake, did you?

03:11.717 --> 03:13.915
I'm amazed to hear the word "fair" come out of your mouth.

03:13.915 --> 03:16.045
What about the cake?

03:16.045 --> 03:20.175
O-Oh, nothing! Nothing for you to worry about, Riju.

03:20.434 --> 03:23.002
Dad, I wonder if that cake was old.

03:23.001 --> 03:26.175
Those two got really sick after they ate it.

03:26.176 --> 03:28.915
R-Really? That's...

03:29.192 --> 03:32.827
They must've eaten something bad before they came here.

03:32.827 --> 03:37.045
Yeah, you're right! Dad would never serve anything bad.

03:37.131 --> 03:39.740
Of course I wouldn't, Riju!

03:40.040 --> 03:42.013
Arrow: Guilt

03:42.613 --> 03:45.566
Well, I'm going to keep playing the game in my room!

03:45.959 --> 03:48.914
Don't even think that I owe you one now.

03:48.915 --> 03:50.437
Wouldn't dream of it.

03:50.437 --> 03:54.045
More importantly, why don't you try
thinking about Riju a little for once?

03:54.045 --> 03:57.088
You drive his friends away every time they come over...

03:57.763 --> 04:00.612
Are you trying to stop him from
making good friends like me?

04:01.437 --> 04:05.219
You're exactly the kind of friend I didn't want him to make!

04:05.219 --> 04:11.349
Listen, you're mistaken if you think every man
that approaches Riju has dishonest intentions.

04:11.693 --> 04:13.045
It's not a mistake!

04:13.045 --> 04:18.175
Ten of his friends have already snapped and tried
to attack me when I pressed them about it!

04:18.741 --> 04:19.914
Every single one of those worms...

04:20.697 --> 04:22.741
And then? What'd you do?

04:23.038 --> 04:24.741
Shunsuke?

04:24.998 --> 04:26.654
What's gotten into you all of a sudden?

04:28.175 --> 04:30.175
So what did you do?

04:30.175 --> 04:33.567
What do you think I did? I kicked them
in the balls and threw them out.

04:35.045 --> 04:38.566
Even so, you're not conscious enough of yourself.

04:39.971 --> 04:43.523
You look like this, but you're in your
thirties... It's practically fraud.

04:50.399 --> 04:53.393
Sensei. You're there, aren't you?

04:53.393 --> 04:55.437
Takatsukasa-sensei!

04:55.570 --> 04:57.437
Fu-Funaba!

04:57.437 --> 04:59.784
Oh, you look quite relaxed.

05:00.158 --> 05:03.349
The fact that you're playing around right now
must mean that it's finished, correct?

05:03.437 --> 05:05.350
I'm taking a break right now.

05:05.350 --> 05:06.654
Its almost done!

05:06.654 --> 05:10.523
Well then, why don't we go get back to work?

05:10.523 --> 05:12.784
Okay, I'm going back to Riju's room.

05:12.784 --> 05:15.132
Wait! The two of you can't be alone together!

05:15.132 --> 05:18.828
Riju... Riju's going to be taken by a beast!

05:22.784 --> 05:25.132
It's over, Funaba...

05:25.132 --> 05:27.610
Thank you for your hard work.

05:27.611 --> 05:30.523
Here's the reward I told you about earlier.

05:30.605 --> 05:37.393
It's that item you wanted, best-selling mystery author
Saki Shunka-sensei's hand-written plot notes.

05:37.393 --> 05:42.089
Honestly, do you know how much trouble
I went through to get this?

05:42.654 --> 05:45.828
Thanks, Funaba! I'll take good care of it!

05:47.539 --> 05:50.523
W-Well, I'll e-excuse myself if you don't mind...

05:50.523 --> 05:53.088
I'm counting on you for the next installment, too!

05:53.089 --> 05:54.871
I'll just be leaving now...

05:56.045 --> 05:57.871
Sure, thanks.

06:00.350 --> 06:01.958
It's like a dream!

06:01.959 --> 06:07.267
Handwritten notes of the author who inspired me
to become a writer myself, here in my hands!

06:08.143 --> 06:10.103
I wonder what kind of woman she is.

06:12.654 --> 06:14.132
See you, Riju.

06:14.900 --> 06:17.524
Bye, Shunsuke! See you later!

06:21.045 --> 06:22.001
Shunsuke.

06:25.132 --> 06:28.262
Oh, are you going to see me to the gate?

06:28.915 --> 06:33.437
Who would?! I came to tell you to stay away from Riju!

06:35.567 --> 06:38.871
Or so I keep saying, but you haven't backed off at all!

06:38.872 --> 06:41.176
I'm Riju's best friend, after all.

06:42.177 --> 06:45.132
Sometimes, I almost wonder if he's the real thing.

06:45.132 --> 06:48.045
He's silently endured all of my harassment for four years...

06:51.853 --> 06:53.002
What is that?

06:55.190 --> 06:56.175
Don't touch!

06:56.872 --> 06:59.567
This belongs to someone very important to me.

07:00.480 --> 07:03.865
Someone... important? A woman?

07:04.350 --> 07:05.437
W-Well...

07:05.437 --> 07:07.350
It's none of your business.

07:09.371 --> 07:12.480
Yes. You're right, it's none of my business.

07:12.876 --> 07:17.697
No one has the right to interfere with two people
in love; they're free to do as they please.

07:18.171 --> 07:22.219
Are you saying that no matter what happens
between you and Riju, I can't say anything?

07:22.828 --> 07:24.914
If I am, what would you do about it?

07:24.915 --> 07:26.045
I won't allow it!

07:26.045 --> 07:29.740
You wouldn't understand how it feels to be betrayed
by someone you thought was your best friend!

07:31.175 --> 07:32.741
You've had this experience?

07:33.103 --> 07:35.523
Yeah... Yeah, I have.

07:35.523 --> 07:39.262
So I don't want Riju to ever feel that way!

07:39.776 --> 07:42.305
Especially not because of you; Riju really likes you.

07:42.305 --> 07:44.489
Well then, you have nothing to worry about.

07:45.448 --> 07:47.784
I'm in love with someone else.

07:52.915 --> 07:56.784
Oh? Even a cheeky brat like you is in love with someone!

07:56.784 --> 07:59.349
So? Who is she? Eh? Eh? Eh?

07:59.350 --> 08:01.480
Does it bother you?

08:01.590 --> 08:02.785
Well...

08:02.784 --> 08:07.871
Are you just trying to tease me? Or are
you genuinely curious about me?

08:08.221 --> 08:12.480
If you show me what you're hiding, I'll tell you who I love.

08:12.976 --> 08:16.349
This belongs to a woman who has my endless respect.

08:16.350 --> 08:19.774
It's Saki Shunka-sensei's handwritten story draft!

08:20.484 --> 08:23.132
Oh, that's all it is...?

08:23.132 --> 08:24.697
"That's all?"

08:24.697 --> 08:25.480
Eh?

08:25.822 --> 08:28.653
Saki Shunka-sensei is my aspiration!

08:28.654 --> 08:31.393
Don't refer to something of hers as "that's all!"

08:31.393 --> 08:36.002
Chisato-san... you really like that author that much.

08:37.626 --> 08:40.524
"Like?" That's not it.

08:40.523 --> 08:44.349
I love her!

08:46.885 --> 08:50.089
So, if that author came up to you
and said, "Go out with me...?"

08:50.959 --> 08:54.306
1-I'd never even thought of that...

08:56.045 --> 09:02.610
But, yeah... I feel like I want to know more about her.

09:05.779 --> 09:09.001
Don't forget those words, okay?

09:21.523 --> 09:23.001
Thanks for dinner!

09:30.887 --> 09:34.262
I never got to hear who Shunsuke's in love with!

09:34.262 --> 09:37.262
Damn it, it's really bothering me!

09:37.644 --> 09:41.610
Hey, why do I have to be this bothered about Shunsuke?!

09:42.065 --> 09:44.305
Dad, is something wrong with Shunsuke?

09:44.484 --> 09:46.523
N-No, nothing!

09:46.523 --> 09:49.914
Okay. Well, I'm going to run over to Shunsuke's house.

09:49.959 --> 09:52.219
Sure, be careful--

09:55.828 --> 09:56.871
You can't go!

09:57.956 --> 10:00.001
What do you have to do at Shunsuke's house?

10:00.001 --> 10:04.218
Shunsuke forgot his notes for the next test!

10:04.784 --> 10:09.219
If a boy as adorable as Riju went out at night...

10:09.872 --> 10:11.828
You're really cute!

10:11.828 --> 10:13.697
Let's have some fun together!

10:15.523 --> 10:19.431
Let's do something that feels good!

10:17.005 --> 10:21.980
No! Help me, Dad!

10:28.611 --> 10:31.263
What happened to you? Your clothes are all...

10:36.119 --> 10:39.784
How terrible... I'll comfort you!

10:39.784 --> 10:44.168
No, stop, Shunsuke!

10:51.611 --> 10:54.219
This notebook is all part of his plan!

10:54.219 --> 10:57.305
Er, I mean, it's late, so Dad'll take it over for you, okay?

10:57.766 --> 10:59.350
Can you draw me a map?

10:59.684 --> 11:00.935
Sure...

11:10.445 --> 11:12.436
This handwriting...

11:12.436 --> 11:14.657
Dad, here it is.

11:18.001 --> 11:19.131
Dad?

11:19.447 --> 11:24.709
What's the meaning of this? Saki Shunka-sensei
and Shunsuke have the same handwriting?!

11:32.300 --> 11:33.132
This is it.

11:37.514 --> 11:38.916
It's open?

11:39.436 --> 11:41.523
Shunsuke, you're there, aren't you? I'm coming in.

11:41.851 --> 11:44.740
Chisato-san? Why are you here?

11:44.741 --> 11:47.175
Is something wrong?

11:47.482 --> 11:49.001
That notebook...

11:49.001 --> 11:54.530
Shunsuke, are you... Saki Shunka?

11:56.915 --> 11:59.828
No reason to talk in the entranceway. Come inside.

11:59.828 --> 12:01.566
There's no one else home right now.

12:01.566 --> 12:02.784
O-Okay.

12:04.290 --> 12:05.218
Come in.

12:07.523 --> 12:12.349
This is... This is Saki Shunka-sensei's
plot notes for the Mizuki series!

12:12.436 --> 12:15.089
This is an unpublished short story!

12:15.718 --> 12:21.432
You really are... Saki Shunka-sensei?

12:23.059 --> 12:25.001
Why didn't you tell me?

12:26.271 --> 12:30.437
You already hate me because of Riju.

12:30.436 --> 12:35.871
If you found out that a younger man was a more popular
author, I thought it would hurt your pride.

12:36.072 --> 12:39.263
That's the part of you I can't stand!

12:39.828 --> 12:42.480
But Saki Shunka is a whole different story.

12:43.204 --> 12:47.436
Right now, I have this vehement desire
to... throw myself into your arms!

12:47.876 --> 12:50.133
What the hell are you talking about?

12:50.132 --> 12:52.001
This is Saki Shunka we're talking about!

12:52.001 --> 12:55.088
If you're in love with someone, you should know how I feel!

12:57.760 --> 12:59.132
You're right...

13:00.889 --> 13:02.766
I understand quite well.

13:09.314 --> 13:13.655
I don't like it... you being in love with someone else...

13:14.068 --> 13:15.523
And why is that?

13:15.523 --> 13:19.610
Because that person gets to have my
beloved Saki Shunka all to herself!

13:19.611 --> 13:21.915
Of course I'd be jealous.

13:22.410 --> 13:23.611
Oh, really.

13:23.611 --> 13:27.654
If even you're having trouble with her, she must
be really rebellious and hard to handle,

13:27.654 --> 13:31.219
someone who thinks nothing of committing
wickedly evil deeds!

13:31.711 --> 13:33.132
You've got that right.

13:33.379 --> 13:37.393
But she must be stunningly beautiful
to have captured your attention...

13:37.550 --> 13:42.175
Yes. Absolutely gorgeous. And...

13:42.175 --> 13:45.045
That's enough! I don't want to hear any more!

13:45.045 --> 13:48.045
No, I need you to hear this.

13:48.478 --> 13:53.697
I asked you earlier today, remember? "What would
you do if Saki Shunka asked you out?"

13:55.652 --> 13:57.828
I love you, Chisato-san.

13:57.828 --> 14:00.828
Shu-Shunsuke! Wait a second!

14:00.828 --> 14:03.001
No. I won't wait anymore.

14:07.436 --> 14:10.871
I'd been holding back because I thought it would hurt Riju.

14:12.480 --> 14:13.610
Shunsuke!

14:14.796 --> 14:16.480
But if we both feel the same, then there's no problem.

14:17.048 --> 14:19.480
Idiot! Who said we feel the same!

14:19.480 --> 14:21.784
In the first place, we're both men!

14:22.220 --> 14:26.641
But I'm the object of your eternal affection, Saki Shunka.

14:28.219 --> 14:29.727
That's not fair!

14:30.350 --> 14:31.741
Call it whatever you wish.

14:31.741 --> 14:34.262
As long as I can make you mine...

14:35.984 --> 14:38.089
Shunsuke? Do you have a guest?

14:39.279 --> 14:40.306
What is it, Dad?

14:40.305 --> 14:43.958
I bought some sushi, I thought we could eat together.

14:48.037 --> 14:50.748
A-Are you... Takatsukasa Chisato?!

14:54.711 --> 14:58.465
Kanzaki-senpai!

15:00.550 --> 15:03.479
Kanzaki-senpai is Shunsuke's dad...?

15:05.346 --> 15:08.436
Chisato, it really is you!

15:08.436 --> 15:12.480
We parted ways like that, I'd always
wondered how you were doing...

15:13.132 --> 15:15.262
Why are you here?

15:23.323 --> 15:26.090
Chisato-san is my friend's father.

15:26.534 --> 15:29.045
He brought something I had forgotten over for me.

15:29.045 --> 15:31.392
I see. What a coincidence!

15:31.831 --> 15:34.262
It must mean something that we've been reunited here.

15:34.262 --> 15:37.523
As two fathers, I hope we can be friends from now on.

15:37.879 --> 15:39.393
"Friends?"

15:39.589 --> 15:42.654
How can you say that with a smile on your face?

15:43.176 --> 15:46.480
My humiliation at being betrayed by
a senpai I thought was my friend...

15:47.055 --> 15:48.306
Chisato...

15:48.765 --> 15:51.828
I felt so wretched, so miserable after you did that to me...

15:51.828 --> 15:54.088
You don't understand anything!

15:54.915 --> 15:55.915
Chisato-san!

15:58.915 --> 16:00.089
Chisato-san, wait!

16:01.944 --> 16:03.237
Chisato...

16:25.718 --> 16:30.002
Will you tell me what happened between you and Dad?

16:32.350 --> 16:37.479
Kanzaki, Sakaki... why are your last names different?

16:37.897 --> 16:41.480
I heard my father's parents divorced
when he was still in school.

16:41.480 --> 16:43.152
But more importantly...

16:43.986 --> 16:48.523
Kanzaki-senpai was the student council
president, and I really looked up to him.

16:48.741 --> 16:51.610
I was his secretary, so over time, we got to know each other.

16:51.611 --> 16:55.523
When I became one of his close friends, I was so happy...

16:55.832 --> 16:59.046
But...! Senpai...

17:00.586 --> 17:04.958
I never would have thought that the best friend you
said had betrayed you was actually my father.

17:07.009 --> 17:08.741
I'm sorry for causing a scene like that.

17:09.053 --> 17:10.638
I'm fine now.

17:11.722 --> 17:13.057
Wait here.

17:14.100 --> 17:17.132
I'll go "take care" of him with a perfect crime.

17:17.132 --> 17:18.610
Wait, wait!

17:18.611 --> 17:21.306
Don't declare patricide so lightly!

17:24.986 --> 17:26.914
Are you covering for him?

17:28.523 --> 17:31.993
I can't forgive him for hurting you!

17:33.244 --> 17:35.654
Why are you so angry about it?

17:36.080 --> 17:40.741
Have you forgotten? It's because I love you, of course!

17:40.741 --> 17:45.697
Are you serious? I'm older than you, and a man!

17:45.698 --> 17:51.001
So would you hate Saki Shunka because
he was a younger man?

17:51.001 --> 17:54.697
No way! My feelings aren't that half-hearted!

17:55.349 --> 17:57.017
Neither are mine.

18:06.827 --> 18:09.088
Dad!

18:10.323 --> 18:13.915
We can't do this! If you and I have that
kind of relationship, Riju will be hurt!

18:13.915 --> 18:18.045
You're just doing the same thing
as Kanzaki-senpai, Shunsuke!

18:18.045 --> 18:19.206
The same?

18:19.707 --> 18:24.958
Riju is most important to me. I want Shunsuke
to stay a good friend to Riju!

18:25.296 --> 18:28.305
That's right! That time, senpai forced me to...

18:28.633 --> 18:29.843
It's not the same!

18:31.469 --> 18:34.784
Unlike with Dad, you're in love with me, aren't you?

18:34.784 --> 18:36.741
That's why you're not seriously resisting.

18:37.523 --> 18:40.740
Chisato-san, you really love me, too.

18:41.979 --> 18:43.439
I hate you!

18:45.698 --> 18:47.523
1 misjudged you, Shunsuke!

18:47.523 --> 18:48.611
Chisato-san!

18:49.320 --> 18:54.534
Of course I knew that Shunsuke and
Kanzaki-senpai aren't the same.

18:55.523 --> 18:58.306
Telling him that I hate him was just my stubbornness.

18:59.784 --> 19:04.914
To tell him "I love you" would be
to betray Riju... I can't do that!

19:09.262 --> 19:13.262
Takatsukasa-sensei. How is the manuscript coming along?

19:13.928 --> 19:17.219
Yes, I'm working on it.

19:19.219 --> 19:22.305
It's completely white!

19:22.305 --> 19:24.740
I'm the one who wants to heave a sigh!

19:25.064 --> 19:29.001
Honestly, here I am having enough
trouble with Saki-sensei...

19:29.001 --> 19:32.784
Is something wrong with Shun-mean, Saki-sensei?

19:33.239 --> 19:35.958
It goes beyond just "wrong." He's
saying he can't write anymore!

19:36.701 --> 19:39.785
He's insisting on ending the Mizuki series.

19:39.784 --> 19:43.999
It might have something to do with the
fact that you found out his identity...

19:45.626 --> 19:47.378
Where are you going, Sensei?

19:48.170 --> 19:50.349
Funaba, I'll never ask you for anything again.

19:51.465 --> 19:54.401
Just let me go!

19:51.465 --> 19:54.401
Note: The Japanese phrase for "Let me go!" is the same as "Let me come!" (meant sexually)

19:54.566 --> 19:57.610
B-B-But, you know, the manuscript!

19:58.014 --> 20:00.033
If you'll just let me go now, I'll do anything!

20:00.391 --> 20:02.143
So let me go!

20:02.678 --> 20:05.751
Arrows: "Let me go!"

20:06.314 --> 20:07.959
Please, let me go!

20:09.262 --> 20:10.219
Thanks!

20:17.437 --> 20:18.219
Shunsuke!

20:19.452 --> 20:21.828
Is it true that you can't write novels anymore?

20:21.827 --> 20:23.219
You...

20:23.873 --> 20:29.479
You rejected me personally, but when it comes
to Saki Shunka, you're quite passionate.

20:30.546 --> 20:33.915
This is the first time I've ever seen Shunsuke look so cold...

20:33.915 --> 20:38.566
I see, the only one you really love is Saki Shunka.

20:38.804 --> 20:40.566
Shunsuke, I...

20:40.566 --> 20:42.132
Please leave.

20:43.601 --> 20:45.871
What part of "get out" do you not understand?!

20:46.145 --> 20:47.350
Shunsuke...

20:47.350 --> 20:50.871
I guess I really am just like my dad.

20:51.784 --> 20:53.697
If you want to run, you better do it now.

20:53.698 --> 20:57.132
If you don't, I don't know what I might do.

21:05.219 --> 21:06.566
Shunsuke!

21:10.378 --> 21:12.785
No, stop!

21:13.047 --> 21:17.523
What's the matter? If you don't put up
a real fight, I'm going to take you.

21:21.263 --> 21:25.436
No, we can't! If we go any further,
I won't be able to love only Riju!

21:26.437 --> 21:30.958
I mean my eyes already follow you more
than Riju whenever you're around,

21:30.959 --> 21:33.480
and even when we're eating dinner, I keep asking Riju,

21:34.026 --> 21:41.992
"How was Shunsuke today?" or "When's Shunsuke
coming over?" because I love hearing about you...

21:43.744 --> 21:45.088
What's wrong, Shunsuke?

21:47.123 --> 21:50.003
Do you not realize you just made a major confession to me?

21:51.210 --> 21:52.958
Just tell me one thing.

21:52.959 --> 21:58.001
How do you really feel about me--me as
Sakaki Shunsuke, not Saki Shunka.

21:58.001 --> 22:01.262
If you'll tell me, I'll give up on you.

22:04.598 --> 22:06.436
L... love you.

22:09.103 --> 22:12.732
I love you, Sakaki Shunsuke, for the man you are.

22:14.650 --> 22:16.393
You finally said it.

22:16.652 --> 22:18.741
I won't ever let you go now.

22:18.741 --> 22:21.088
Let's be happy together, okay?

22:23.993 --> 22:25.741
You just said you'd give up!

22:26.245 --> 22:28.088
Of course I was lying.

22:28.089 --> 22:30.480
I've been controlling myself for so long.

22:30.480 --> 22:34.001
There's no way I could give up now,
knowing you feel the same.

22:34.001 --> 22:35.262
You tricked me!

22:35.262 --> 22:38.088
I even love how you can be so stupid sometimes.

22:38.089 --> 22:39.045
What?!

22:39.633 --> 22:42.045
Chisato-san, I love you, too.

22:45.437 --> 22:48.393
No, I can't... If I let myself be swept away in this...

22:57.480 --> 23:01.523
Shunsuke... we can't go any further...

23:06.698 --> 23:07.784
No...

23:11.999 --> 23:15.566
It felt so disgusting when Kanzaki-senpai touched me,

23:15.566 --> 23:20.045
but with Shunsuke, not only is it okay, it's wonderful...

23:24.611 --> 23:27.567
I love you, Chisato-san.

23:30.518 --> 23:31.481
Chisato-san.

23:31.480 --> 23:33.001
No!

23:33.784 --> 23:36.262
Is it your first time this way?

23:36.398 --> 23:37.914
Of course it is!

23:39.698 --> 23:44.045
That makes me very happy. I'll be your first.

23:44.323 --> 23:45.653
Relax...

24:04.301 --> 24:07.088
I was swept away...

24:07.089 --> 24:08.741
What should I say to Riju?!

24:09.849 --> 24:10.742
Chisato-san--

24:10.741 --> 24:13.001
Shunsuke, are you there?

24:14.436 --> 24:15.349
Dad?

24:15.350 --> 24:17.231
I'll talk to you from here, so I want you to listen.

24:18.045 --> 24:25.045
About me and Chisato... back then, I wasn't trying to
get close to him simply out of curiosity or as a joke.

24:25.990 --> 24:32.089
I chose the wrong way to convey my feelings,
but I really felt pure affection for Chisato.

24:32.089 --> 24:34.248
I just don't want you to misunderstand that.

24:34.999 --> 24:35.915
Dad...

24:35.915 --> 24:42.002
It might be too late to ask for forgiveness... but
I want you to at least understand that much.

24:42.784 --> 24:44.045
Senpai...

24:51.974 --> 24:55.566
Why don't you just say it honestly, like he did?

24:55.895 --> 25:00.306
If you explain your true feelings
to Riju, I think he'll understand.

25:00.649 --> 25:03.652
After all, he is my friend.

25:04.350 --> 25:09.523
Yeah... But if you're going to say that,
I say it's because he's my son!

25:11.327 --> 25:13.568
Well then, there are no problems, right?

25:14.747 --> 25:15.827
That's how it is!

25:18.350 --> 25:19.567
Riju.

25:21.480 --> 25:23.305
Riju?! What are you doing here?!

25:23.672 --> 25:28.088
I came to see how Shunsuke was doing, but
it looks like I interrupted something.

25:28.089 --> 25:28.741
N-Not at all!

25:28.741 --> 25:32.890
You see, his jacuzzi bath really does wonders for stiff
shoulders so he invited me over to try it out--

25:33.724 --> 25:35.305
Riju, please listen.

25:35.684 --> 25:38.088
We want to have a serious relationship.

25:38.089 --> 25:41.349
What are you doing?! I came up with a great story...!

25:41.350 --> 25:43.697
Didn't you agree you'd tell him honestly?

25:43.698 --> 25:45.654
That doesn't mean we have to do it now!

25:45.986 --> 25:47.828
Okay, I understand.

25:48.697 --> 25:52.958
You two are going out, right? I could
tell by how you were acting.

25:52.959 --> 25:54.741
Good for you, Dad!

25:55.204 --> 25:59.175
The person I like right now is a man,
too, so I know how you feel.

26:00.028 --> 26:00.876
Oh?

26:01.669 --> 26:04.306
Shunsuke, take care of Dad, okay?

26:04.305 --> 26:06.740
I'm going to head home!

26:09.551 --> 26:11.741
Isn't that great? He understood.

26:11.741 --> 26:14.219
That might be great, but the rest isn't!

26:15.480 --> 26:20.349
All the trouble I went through to chase off the
guys who tried to get near Riju, for nothing!

26:21.814 --> 26:23.046
You're really thick!

26:23.045 --> 26:27.697
I'm telling you, the ones who followed
Riju home were after you!

26:28.821 --> 26:34.133
Well, that ended up inspiring the Mizuki
series, so maybe I should be grateful.

26:34.535 --> 26:35.958
What do you mean?

26:36.654 --> 26:40.611
Mizuki, the blood-thirsty killer of the
Mizuki series, is like my alter ego.

26:40.611 --> 26:46.698
I couldn't actually kill the men who tried to get close to you,
so I amused myself by devising ways to kill them on paper.

26:46.698 --> 26:49.132
Somehow it ended up being a best-seller.

26:49.523 --> 26:55.219
Then the reason you were saying you'd end the
Mizuki series is because I rejected you?!

26:55.431 --> 26:59.915
That's right. Without you, these novels
would never have been written.

27:00.523 --> 27:01.784
Shunsuke...

27:01.784 --> 27:07.175
One could say that you created Saki Shunka.

27:07.176 --> 27:11.393
Oh! That's the most seductive pick-up line I've ever heard!

27:11.822 --> 27:13.523
Please, settle down.

27:13.523 --> 27:16.914
I'm not sure how to deal with feeling
jealous of Saki Shunka...

27:21.373 --> 27:22.436
Don't be jealous.

27:23.667 --> 27:28.001
You're also Saki Shunka, but right
now it's you I love the most
